    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/c2eae01838f624f88bb447ee130b9270.poster.avif?t=1726098272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/c2eae01838f624f88bb447ee130b9270.webm?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/c2eae01838f624f88bb447ee130b9270.mp4?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Degenerates is an action-packed, Virtual Reality superhero game. Take control of 3 different super-heroes each with their own unique set of powers: <strong>Earth, Telekinesis, and Electricity</strong>. Fight off waves of enemies in large combat arenas featuring destructible environments and epic boss fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/e57358d467b787584832e0793ea1b121.poster.avif?t=1726098272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/e57358d467b787584832e0793ea1b121.webm?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/e57358d467b787584832e0793ea1b121.mp4?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After being deemed a threat to society, a group of young metahumans are detained in a government research lab for people with superpowers. There they are forced to use their powers to fight for survival. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/8f56647e245309b49246f24d77f83979.poster.avif?t=1726098272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/8f56647e245309b49246f24d77f83979.webm?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/8f56647e245309b49246f24d77f83979.mp4?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME PLAY MECHANICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shoot, block, and parry enemy projectiles to build power<br></li><li> Slow down time to dodge out of the way of enemy attacks<br></li><li>Perform special attacks to deal powerful damage<br></li><li>Juggle airborne enemies to extend combos and maintain power </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/d4dd0bf02a7e4b77cd49acbc791ffce1.poster.avif?t=1726098272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/d4dd0bf02a7e4b77cd49acbc791ffce1.webm?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/d4dd0bf02a7e4b77cd49acbc791ffce1.mp4?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Physics driven combat system<br></li><li> Explosive particle effects<br></li><li> Destructible environments <br></li><li> Diverse biomes and arenas </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/95151f721cdb54b4238b4ae485d1aafa.poster.avif?t=1726098272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/95151f721cdb54b4238b4ae485d1aafa.webm?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/95151f721cdb54b4238b4ae485d1aafa.mp4?t=1726098272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
